{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9f85a1f0cbca0beae70e6b3e778f9d68533a9801f5c8176a40c5ccd517337ba3", "ja": "え、いきなり！？　\nアタシ、ぶっつけ本番はちょっと……。", "zh": "诶，突然来这个！？  \n我、我不太擅长毫无准备地直接上场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
