{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "0aadffdda8a080d9ec56449ae5bd7ad45f4096c80e1df2134d779ccb318ac322", "ja": "ハーイ行くわよ！　MCリツコ！　華麗に登場！\nアイドルの既成概念打ち破りラッピン", "zh": "嗨——要上啦！MC律子！华丽登场！  \n打破偶像的既有观念，来段说唱——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "e89b9e725b5a9e67ee44b961d242c0e3bc0f753839e33d073d1600f9c287e4ed", "ja": "A TO THE M TO THE I ア・ミ！　大舞台立って\nでっかくなった　ちょーぜつツインズの片割れ　YO", "zh": "A TO THE M TO THE I 亚·美！　登上大舞台\n变得超巨大的　绝赞双胞胎其中一人　YO", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "80dc0790f366e9625a3ce68a0eb679973df3e0bb777782b8bdead915ba9f0a01", "ja": "真美は真美だよ　亜美は亜美だよ　\nMCリツコから教わったHIPHOPの仁義　それは", "zh": "真美就是真美，亚美就是亚美。\n从MC律子那里学到的HIPHOP道义，那就是——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
