{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "34fdf4e468bb54a5f5a92fdf06047a305625e3c70c773a03f9b07dd1167ccfd5", "ja": "え？　あ、あ！！　アタシはアユム、ダンスが得意\nえーっとえーっと　ダンスは得意！！", "zh": "咦？啊、啊！！我是阿步，擅长跳舞\n呃——呃——，我擅长跳舞！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "1457bb084616144bf3eddae7e6e28c7be936021f9c31100476209fad9c7c7a56", "ja": "ダンスが得意　間違いない　劇場イチのダンサー\n初のラッピン　調子はどう？", "zh": "舞蹈很拿手，绝对没错，剧场第一舞者。第一次说唱，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "648e8dfa5681c9ae67903626a603347cd15b3e6d98bbc13f2027865312851e4f", "ja": "調子？　グッド！　ベリーグッド！\n緊張するけど　めちゃ楽しい", "zh": "状态？很好！非常好！\n虽然会紧张，但真的特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "fdc6e33bb615de24ac663c83a3e82229da417897a17f7468e925e4a9b330f407", "ja": "楽しいことが　一番だ　それと愛と　思いやり\n少しの勇気で　出来上がるHIPHOP", "zh": "快乐最重要，还有爱与体贴\n加上一点勇气，就是HIPHOP", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "ccbf7961ff1ec0b84fbca98f18277c3a261e36ccf0c0a267285855f07f89b3d9", "ja": "たくさん怒られ　喧嘩して　つかんだ絆は\n離さない♪　……HEY ロコ！", "zh": "挨过许多训，也吵过架，才抓住的羁绊——  \n我不会放手♪……HEY ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
