{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1032_ayumurajikase", "source_sha256": "198810c6f482b7b1e2575cfc2934766fa81bbe811de579703636caf6d24c1ffa", "ja": "ズンズン♪", "zh": "咚咚♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "6359d7f647b1fa1322c5f1e7b17d98603a4abfd00cc0d7aafd7038f69924406a", "ja": "ほんと、ラジカセも喜んでるみたい。\nそういえば歩、ラジカセいつの間に直ったの？", "zh": "真的，感觉连收音机都很高兴呢。\n说起来，步，你的收音机是什么时候修好的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7187584287727e6ab007e43e475b2b523278475d8205432eac07970b85c550ca", "ja": "それなんだけど……このラジカセ、時々\n急に声が聞こえてきたりしてさ。だ、大丈夫かな……？", "zh": "是这样的……这台收录机有时候会突然传出声音。会、会不会有问题啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1035_011ami", "source_sha256": "aa0566df82c461f924e7fe3208d38443ce99a70520e47ecd946fec38b14cf874", "ja": "は！？　なにそれ、こわっ！！", "zh": "哈！？那是什么，好可怕！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "5cbf89ad5e807d870b282ca75d6d48d9a606efc390f311e07907e1d367327f63", "ja": "ノープロブレムですよ、アミ！　声の正体は、\nカセットテープのアリサのボイパでしたから。", "zh": "没问题哦，亚美！那个声音的来源是，\n卡式磁带里亚利沙的口技表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "e41461d39a14c188174cf2b13ef20ac460e76a88dfbec420b22848e75b747a87", "ja": "それ、本当に亜利沙の声なんでしょうね……。あ、\nそろそろ劇場に戻りましょう。さあ、次のレッスンよ！", "zh": "那真的是亚利沙的声音吧……啊，我们差不多该回剧场了。好了，接下来是下一项训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "22e762d7e0cac2deee73cf8fbb1aae153ad7c5b2ea1f522c189f97657b9434cb", "ja": "ねえ、兄ちゃん、兄ちゃん。\n真美たちの可能性、ラップで広がったかな？", "zh": "呐，哥哥，哥哥。\n真美她们的可能性，有没有因为说唱而变得更加广阔呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "4d25ae31c8d1140ff22ed4429d64e53d55b613731d9e2af44489cca2b2e53b4e", "ja": "ああ、すごく広がったと思うよ。", "zh": "啊，我觉得确实拓宽了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "a3729145b37dd767f0f465089f930cf9df2513a7a26a32d4b0c31884cb8c6a9b", "ja": "そんなんじゃダメだよ、兄ちゃん！\nここはラップで表現しなきゃ。", "zh": "那样可不行啦，哥哥！\n这里得用说唱来表达才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b08e95eaa231c39cd2546f582554552384db888909822058e1009447ba121440", "ja": "ええと……広がった　超絶激広がった　可能性は無限大\n今日の日とみんなとの出会いに感謝だな真美　ピース", "zh": "呃……拓宽了，超级无敌拓宽了，可能性无限大。感谢今天，以及和大家的相遇啊，真美，比耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1042_012mam", "source_sha256": "73fd9f9ac8e2293d13f209430ab001a50098b8c35ecc3714a1663588f7050a02", "ja": "うん……ピース！！", "zh": "嗯……耶！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "bea6532d5b9633d369d675f5568545dcf57be3f38e30acca4fe61d2f851472c9", "ja": "（常に挑戦し、価値観をアップデートしていく。\nそれこそがアイドル……ピースでチルな存在だ！）", "zh": "（不断挑战自我，持续更新自己的价值观。这才是偶像……一个和平又惬意的存在！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
